#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:5
#: fa24b50767c24f23a7de17c09b58ab6d
msgid "Hexsoon 77G MWW Radar"
msgstr "Hexsoon 77G 毫米波雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:7
#: 67a6ac57cce44d0d81e65ba7df332931
msgid ""
"The `Hexsoon HS77G MMW radar <http://www.hexsoon.com/en/list-4-27.html>`__ "
"(available in `20m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-84-684.html>`__, `40m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-87-23.html>`__, and `80m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-7-973.html>`__ versions) are "
"77Ghz-band radar useful for horizontal :ref:`object avoidance <common-"
"object-avoidance-landing-page>`"
msgstr ""
"`Hexsoon HS77G 毫米波雷达 <http://www.hexsoon.com/en/list-4-27.html>`__（提供 `20m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-84-684.html>`__、`40m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-87-23.html>`__ 和 `80m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-7-973.html>`__ 版本）是 77GHz "
"频段雷达，适用于水平 :ref:`避障 <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:15
#: 91178b7e906949e2ba3387e577d127c0
msgid "ArduPilot only supports the CAN versions of these sensors"
msgstr "ArduPilot 仅支持这些传感器的 CAN 版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:19
#: 539730a053274a798c2fd8a4ead6f3a6
msgid "Support is available in Copter and Rover versions 4.6 and higher"
msgstr "Copter 和 Rover 4.6 及更高版本提供支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:22
#: 058ba88e6aad44058db73f4d95971d17
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:24
#: bb101661d50b42ab95a49d87cf31ee3f
msgid ""
"Mount the radar to the vehicle so that the radar senses obstacles "
"horizontally.  The power and communication wire should be to the right."
msgstr "将雷达安装到飞行器上，使雷达水平感测障碍物。电源和通信线应在右侧。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:30
#: 471fd678bca44833ac2773f9ed3fa8e3
msgid ""
"Connect the radar to the autopilot's CAN port as shown above and set the "
"following parameters assuming the radar is connected to CAN1:"
msgstr "如上图所示将雷达连接到飞控的 CAN 接口，并假设雷达连接到 CAN1，设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:32
#: 9dce7648b4404ce794ab00238bb12c8d
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (First CAN driver)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（第一路 CAN 驱动）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:33
#: 15b119a5db8641be83d3d650767c5238
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE <CAN_P1_BITRATE>` = 500000"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE <CAN_P1_BITRATE>` = 500000"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:34
#: f8250805239842cd954c88cae7b93fe6
msgid ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 14 (RadarCAN)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 14（RadarCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:35
#: bbb29e920def4404862274cf588bdb35
msgid ":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = 18 (Hexsoon Radar)"
msgstr ":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = 18（Hexsoon Radar）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:36
#: 4c99123d4c9440f19ef9ecbf0f44c440
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX1_YAW_CORR <PRX1_YAW_CORR>` = 0 (forward) if the radar is mounted "
"pointing forwards"
msgstr ":ref:`PRX1_YAW_CORR <PRX1_YAW_CORR>` = 0（朝前）如果雷达安装方向朝前"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:38
#: 1a3dd272e82a4cfbb5721ba4c8a55e49
msgid "After setting the above parameters reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "设置上述参数后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:41
#: 3484602c4435469eb8ecfe855b5c395f
msgid "Connecting Multiple Radar"
msgstr "连接多个雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:43
#: 517fee67807a4010a244ea920dd0dce2
msgid ""
"Up to 3 radar may be connected to a single autopilot.  Please follow these "
"steps:"
msgstr "最多可将 3 个雷达连接到单个飞控。请按照以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:45
#: f93698b012ca4dfead520bdafcd28a26
msgid ""
"Connect each radar's GND, CANL and CANH pins to one of the autopilot's CAN "
"ports as shown above"
msgstr "将每个雷达的 GND、CANL 和 CANH 引脚连接到飞控的某个 CAN 接口（如上图所示）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:46
#: 5f0562cd9ff3437bb4602356d6af5a94
msgid ""
"Connect each radar's GND and VCC pins to an external BEC providing between "
"5V and 28V"
msgstr "将每个雷达的 GND 和 VCC 引脚连接到提供 5V 至 28V 电压的外部 BEC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:47
#: b9c586cd4179477b8addb518ec02ee8c
msgid ""
"Download and run the `configuration tool "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/download/download-11-748.html>`__ to set each "
"radar's ID to a unique number"
msgstr ""
"下载并运行 `配置工具 "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/download/download-11-748.html>`__，将每个雷达的 ID "
"设置为唯一编号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:48
#: ce50b2179597412e8d9399b4d5373c33
msgid ":ref:`PRX2_TYPE <PRX2_TYPE>` = 18 (Hexsoon Radar)"
msgstr ":ref:`PRX2_TYPE <PRX2_TYPE>` = 18（Hexsoon Radar）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:49
#: c7a5edade8c9483bb6ff09dad2510999
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX2_YAW_CORR <PRX2_YAW_CORR>` = angle that the 2nd radar is mounted "
"at relative to the forward direction of the vehicle"
msgstr ":ref:`PRX2_YAW_CORR <PRX2_YAW_CORR>` = 第二个雷达相对于飞行器前进方向的安装角度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:50
#: 63e7bf56cfcd4f87ae9b76eacd730cea
msgid ":ref:`PRX3_TYPE <PRX3_TYPE>` = 18 (Hexsoon Radar)"
msgstr ":ref:`PRX3_TYPE <PRX3_TYPE>` = 18（Hexsoon Radar）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:51
#: 05f4e02e4c364de090a7cf340517de62
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX3_YAW_CORR <PRX3_YAW_CORR>` = angle that the 3rd radar is mounted "
"at relative to the forward direction of the vehicle"
msgstr ":ref:`PRX3_YAW_CORR <PRX3_YAW_CORR>` = 第三个雷达相对于飞行器前进方向的安装角度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:53
#: 6b51391450804ef39969d3d745561992
msgid ""
"More details on using this sensor for object avoidance on Copter can be "
"found :ref:`here <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>`."
msgstr ""
"有关在 Copter 上使用此传感器进行避障的更多详细信息，请参见 :ref:`此处 <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:56
#: 0cbc15c5dc4546e1bef51345d762451d
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-radar.rst:58
#: ae2fd0246a1b498f8d7a3865e3ed4547
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请关注「rangefinder1」。"
